      ro: ["Un element istoric cheie pentru History 8.", "O atracție culturală remarcabilă în zona History 8."],
      en: ["UNESCO World Heritage Site since 1995 for its well-preserved colonial center.", "First city in Colombia to declare complete independence from Spain on August 6, 1810.", "Famous worldwide for its exquisite gold and silver filigree jewelry.", "Located on the Mompox depression, an inland delta of the Magdalena River.", "Home to some of the most beautiful colonial churches in the Caribbean region."]
