      en: ["Strategically located at the narrowest point of the Bocachica entrance to Cartagena Bay.", "Features a rare horseshoe-shaped design built between 1753 and 1760.", "Part of the extensive UNESCO World Heritage fortifications of Cartagena.", "Built using coral stone extracted from the surrounding Caribbean reefs.", "Successfully guarded the city against numerous naval attacks by European rivals."]
