      ro: ["Un element istoric cheie pentru History 26.", "O atracție culturală remarcabilă în zona History 26."],
      en: ["Completed in 1770, it is a prime example of late colonial baroque architecture.", "Was the seat of the Spanish Inquisition for the Caribbean for over 50 years.", "Features the 'window of denunciation' for anonymous accusations.", "Houses the Historical Museum of Cartagena and the city's historical archives.", "Located in the beautiful Plaza de Bolívar, the heart of the walled city."]
